5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm so excited! But wait, how do we make sure the money part is fair for everyone this time?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. It would be helpful to see the total costs upfront rather than figuring it out as we go.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I think we should also consider how the space affects us. I want us to feel connected but not overwhelmed.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should look at the logistics. I'm concerned about how much of our limited time is spent just moving between places.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think... maybe we should check the room layouts? Just to make sure everyone is comfortable.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, exactly! I want a plan where the price is set so nobody accidentally pays more than others.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,Then we should compare all-in rates against separate costs. It's the only way to avoid surprises.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, that's a good point. The room arrangements and the balance of alone time are really important for the mood.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If we spend two days just traveling, the trip feels shorter. We need to know the exact transit times.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Yeah... and maybe the bathroom stuff too. It's just... easier if we know how it works.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'll check the all-in rates! I want to see if we can just pay one big price and be done with it.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I'll look into the pricing of offshore houses and the all-in rates as well. I need a clear total.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran to see what worked.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I will investigate the ferry and train schedules, as well as the general transport options.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll look into the bathing hours and the room arrangements. If that's okay.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Yay! Let's find the best deal! I'm going to look at the all-in rates and the offshore house pricing too!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
