60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I want Option C! The inn has those all-in rates, so we can just split the bill once and be happy!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option C is the most financially transparent. We know the cost of the room and meals as a package. I vote for C.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm leaning toward C too. It provides a shared center for us to gather, but the town allows us to step away.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B is the only one that doesn't waste our time. No waiting for ferries or hourly buses. I vote for B.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't like the idea of one room for everyone. Option B has separate rooms... that would be much easier.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, @Daisuke, but the city is so busy! A hot spring town is way more relaxing and the payment is so simple!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, the time loss is a trade-off for the cost certainty. I can't risk the ""loose plan"" of Option B.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, we can ask the inn for separate rooms or a larger suite. The important thing is the shared atmosphere.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"A ""relaxing"" trip is not relaxing if you spend 20% of it waiting for a bus or a boat. B is the logical choice.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm just... worried about the sleep. In the city, I can have my own space. The inn feels... overwhelming.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"Please, please! Let's do the hot spring! It's like a little adventure, and we won't fight over the money!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,The financial predictability of Option C is the only way I can fully commit without anxiety. I'm sticking with C.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,I think C offers the best social balance. We avoid the isolation of B and the overcrowding of A.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"If we choose C, we are accepting a rigid schedule. I cannot support a plan that prioritizes a ""package"" over our actual time.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I want to be helpful, but I think I have to vote for B. I need to know I can sleep.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,"Aww, man! I really wanted the all-in package! But I'll vote for C anyway because it's the most fun!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I've weighed the options. The risk of unexpected costs in B is too high. My vote is C.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,"For the sake of our group harmony and a balanced experience, I vote for Option C.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"I've considered the others, but the travel overhead of C is still too high. I maintain my vote for B.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'm sorry... I'll vote for B. I just think it's the only way I'll be okay.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
